<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Australia initial public offerings Sept 16.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Australia initial public offerings Sept 16.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The companies listed have made application for admission to the official list of the Australian Stock Exchange (ASX) and have been allocated a provisional ASX code. The ASX advises that allocation of a code does not imply that the company's application will be approved.</p>
<p>								   Amount Sought</p>
<p>Company		    Code   Price Underwriter(s)     A$million</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Adelaide Resources NL AND.AX   0.25 McIntosh Corporate    5.00</p>
